; Return values..: Success           - True if ModelID is in the rare-skin set; otherwise False.
; Author.........: KleuTSchi
; Remarks........: Builds a static map (ModelID → True) on first call from several category arrays (e.g., Anniversary buckets,
;                  General). Lookup is O(1) via MapExists().
; Related........: MapExists
